WEBVTT

00:24:29.232 --> 00:24:33.094
and that's not necessarily so,
it just kind of shows up differently.

00:24:33.118 --> 00:24:35.392
CA: So what are the main misconceptions

00:24:35.416 --> 00:24:37.983
that people actually have
about introversion?

00:24:38.007 --> 00:24:42.079
SC: Well, there's a lot of them, but
I think the biggest, biggest one probably,

00:24:42.103 --> 00:24:48.045
is the idea that introverts
are antisocial or misanthropic.

00:24:48.069 --> 00:24:52.746
I think most people really do assume that
on some fundamental level,

00:24:52.770 --> 00:24:54.909
and it's not that at all.

00:24:54.933 --> 00:24:59.265
It really is about just the wish
to socialize differently,

00:24:59.289 --> 00:25:02.271
and wanting to just kind of
allot your social energies